<h1 data-copy-en="Kupie" data-copy-zh="Kupie">Kupie</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Attic conversations, dates and the link to Kupie’s Love Training." data-copy-zh="阁楼交谈、约会，以及Kupie 的爱之训练的独立进度。">Attic conversations, dates and the link to Kupie’s Love Training.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Love_Training:_Rebirth"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Love_Training:_Sylph_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Love_Training:_Reward_Dates_and_Achievements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Love_Training:_Upgrades_and_Key_Items"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Love_Training:_Hearts_and_Charms_Jobs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Love_Training:_NPC_Unlocks"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Love_Training:_Getting_Started"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Celestial_Trumpet_and_Twilight_Stone"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Boardwalk_Sunset_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Personal_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Kupie — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kupie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kupie — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kupie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kupie — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Kupie’s attic relationship is separate from the NPC affection, Hearts, Charms and levels inside Kupie Love Training. Her own route has conversations, two dates and a skill-based repeatable activity.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Schedule_and_Daily_Affection"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Enable her event access through Redeem Crystal Code; the game’s public splash advertises VALENTINE. Then visit Attic. Her portrait is available all day once access is active.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Love_Training:_Emily.27s_First_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Love_Training:_Emily's_First_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Story_Encounters"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>At Known (25), visit for Love Training 101. At Acquaintance (50), No Misunderstandings becomes available; its follow-up The Unnecessary Experiment needs Friend (100).</p><p>For the personal conversation sequence: Small Luxuries → the boardwalk and fair dates → Visible to You → No Notes → Preferred Posting. The fair needs the boardwalk date and first conversation; the tables give exact gates and costs.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Attic Guest</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Attic</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Love Training 101</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Attic</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Misunderstandings</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Attic</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Bigger Picture</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Attic</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Borrowed Time</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Attic</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Celestial Trumpet</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Attic</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Unnecessary Experiment</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Attic</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after No Misunderstandings</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Preferred Posting</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Attic</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); after No Notes</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Small Luxuries</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); after The Unnecessary Experiment</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Visible to You</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after Fair Date with Kupie / Small Luxuries</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Notes</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Crush (400); after Visible to You</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Mystic Seduction needs Crush (400), the learned Mystic Seduction skill and its content access. It takes 120 minutes and 70 Energy, gives 50 base affection and is available once per day. High affection alone cannot replace the skill.</p><p>At In Love (3,000), visit for The Celestial Trumpet. It grants Celestial Trumpet; the minigame guide explains its production effect. With an owned Twilight Stone and In Love, 60-minute bonding is available once per day for one stone level.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Mystic_Seduction_Interaction"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolates</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Chocolate</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+5 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Wine</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Wine</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+10 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mystic Seduction</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Crush (400); learn Mystic Seduction; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; 70 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+50 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk Sunset Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after Restoring the Boardwalk; 17:00–19:59; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; $50; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fair Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after Boardwalk Sunset with Kupie / Small Luxuries; 11:00–14:59; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $150; 45 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate Bonding</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">In Love (3000); carry Twilight Stone</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 stone level; once/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Chocolate gives 5 base affection from Known, four gifts per day. Wine gives 10 from Friend, three per day. Each consumes one matching item. Ordinary relationship gains do not directly fill minigame affection.</p><p>Favorite stats are Charm, Attractiveness, Mystic. The learned Mystic Seduction skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>If her portrait is missing all day, check event access rather than changing the clock.</li><li>For the fair, finish the boardwalk date and Small Luxuries; Close Friend alone is insufficient.</li><li>Mystic Seduction is both a named skill and her activity; learn the skill before selecting the activity.</li><li>Celestial Trumpet and Twilight Stone bonding use ordinary In Love, not a minigame level.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie Love Training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Twilight Stone</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-crystals-and-doomsday.html">Redeeming public event codes</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Mystic Seduction</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Love_Training:_Rebirth"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Love_Training:_Sylph_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Love_Training:_Reward_Dates_and_Achievements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Love_Training:_Upgrades_and_Key_Items"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Love_Training:_Hearts_and_Charms_Jobs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Love_Training:_NPC_Unlocks"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Love_Training:_Getting_Started"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Celestial_Trumpet_and_Twilight_Stone"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Boardwalk_Sunset_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Personal_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Kupie 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kupie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kupie 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kupie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kupie 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Kupie在阁楼的个人关系，与Kupie 的爱之训练里的NPC好感、爱心、魅力和等级分开。她自己的路线包含交谈、两次约会及需要技能的可重复活动。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Schedule_and_Daily_Affection"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>先通过兑换水晶码开启活动权限；游戏公开启动页面列出的代码是VALENTINE。之后到阁楼，权限开启后头像全天出现。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Love_Training:_Emily.27s_First_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Love_Training:_Emily's_First_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Story_Encounters"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>已知（25）后到访进行爱之训练入门；相识（50）后可进行不要误会，其后续不必要的实验还要求朋友（100）。</p><p>个人对话依次为：小小的奢侈 → 木板路与游乐园约会 → 在你眼里 → 不用笔记 → 心仪的驻地。游乐园约会需先完成木板路约会与第一次对话，准确门槛和消耗见表。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">阁楼客人</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">阁楼</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">爱之训练入门</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">阁楼</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不要误会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">阁楼</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">更大的图景</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">阁楼</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">借来的时间</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">阁楼</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">天界号角</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">阁楼</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不必要的实验</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">阁楼</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：不要误会</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">心仪的驻地</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">阁楼</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）；完成：不用笔记</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">小小的奢侈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；完成：不必要的实验</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">在你眼里</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；完成：与Kupie的游乐园约会、小小的奢侈</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不用笔记</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">迷恋（400）；完成：在你眼里</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>神秘诱惑要求迷恋（400）、已学会神秘诱惑及对应内容权限，花费120分钟、70精力，给予50基础好感，每天一次。只有高好感不能代替技能。</p><p>恋爱中（3,000）后，到访进行天界号角，获得天界号角，其生产效果见小游戏指南。持有暮光之石并达到恋爱中后，可每天花60分钟建立一次羁绊，使石头提升1级。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Mystic_Seduction_Interaction"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；巧克力×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+5；每天4次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送葡萄酒</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；葡萄酒×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+10；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">神秘诱惑</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">迷恋（400）；已学会神秘诱惑；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；70精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+50；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">木板路日落约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；完成：重修海滨木栈道；17:00–19:59；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；$50；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">游乐园约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；完成：与 Kupie 在木板路看日落、小小的奢侈；11:00–14:59；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$150；45精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密羁绊</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">恋爱中（3000）；持有暮光之石</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">灵魂石等级+1；每天一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>已知后送巧克力给予5基础好感，每天四次；朋友后送葡萄酒给予10，每天三次。每次消耗对应物品一份，普通关系奖励不会直接填充小游戏好感。</p><p>偏好的属性为魅力、吸引力、神秘。学会神秘诱惑可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>全天找不到头像时，检查活动权限，不必继续调整时钟。</li><li>游乐园约会要先完成木板路约会与小小的奢侈，只有亲密朋友还不够。</li><li>神秘诱惑既是技能名，也是她的行动名，要先学习技能。</li><li>天界号角与暮光之石羁绊要求普通关系达到恋爱中，不看小游戏等级。</li></ul></section>
